--TEST--
the `namespace` keyword names no symbol that a rename can change, so renaming there is refused, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespac<|>e Shop;

class Cart
{
    public int $total = 0;
}
--REQUEST--
rename to=Store
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
